1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,840
Dobry wieczór, good evening. So I am happy to
share with you

2
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:09,020
my experience in this amazing

3
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:12,800
town called Bolesławiec. Not only

4
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:17,300
is it a very charming little town with all of
those

5
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:21,620
colourful buildings and impressive monuments
and churches

6
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:25,000
and the city hall behind me

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,720
and the fountain. It is also considered the
capital

8
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:32,320
