9
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:40,860
It is a world-renowned place for manufacturing
ceramics,

10
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:42,720
and if you want to buy ceramics,

11
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:48,100
I invite you to go to one of the manufacturers
that are spread around the city. Also, do not

12
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:52,420
forget to visit the Museum of Ceramics that
presents

13
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:55,320
amazing artefacts throughout the history

14
00:00:55,320 --> 00:01:00,460
of this place. Of course, you can also view
the exhibits

15
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:02,820
